#. Description
msgid "Automatically deletes All-in-One WP Migration backups (.wpress) once the time you set has passed. Set the time under Settings → Purge AI1WM Backups. Not an official ServMask extension."
msgstr "All-in-One WP Migration のバックアップ（.wpress）を、指定した時間がたったら自動で削除します。削除までの時間は「設定 → バックアップ自動削除」で変えられます。ServMask 社の公式の拡張機能ではありません。"

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:131
#, php-format
msgid "%d day"
msgid_plural "%d days"
msgstr[0] "%d日"

#. translators: %d: number of hours
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:135
#, php-format
msgid "%d hour"
msgid_plural "%d hours"
msgstr[0] "%d時間"

#. translators: %d: number of minutes
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:139
#, php-format
msgid "%d minute"
msgid_plural "%d minutes"
msgstr[0] "%d分"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:141
msgctxt "between parts of a duration"
msgid ", "
msgstr "と"

#. translators: 1: shortest time, 2: longest time
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:328
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Set a time between %1$s and %2$s. The value was changed to fit that range "
"and saved."
msgstr ""
"削除までの時間は %1$s〜%2$s の間で指定してください。範囲に収まる値に直して保"
"存しました。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:341
msgctxt "settings menu"
msgid "Purge AI1WM Backups"
msgstr "バックアップ自動削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:353
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:666
msgid "You are not allowed to delete backups."
msgstr "バックアップを削除する権限がありません。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:784
msgid "Nothing to delete"
msgstr "なし"

#. translators: %s: remaining time
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:787
#, php-format
msgid "in about %s"
msgstr "あと約%s"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:789
msgid "at the next check"
msgstr "次の確認で削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:798
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "分"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:799
msgid "hours"
msgstr "時間"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:800
msgid "days"
msgstr "日"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:808
msgid ""
"Backups (.wpress) made by an AI1WM export stay in a public folder of the "
"site, and anyone who knows the URL can download them. They contain the whole "
"site, including the database and wp-config.php, so this plugin deletes them "
"automatically once the time you set has passed."
msgstr ""
"AI1WM のエクスポートで作られたバックアップ（.wpress）は、サイトの公開フォルダ"
"に置かれたままになり、URL が分かれば誰でもダウンロードできます。中身はサイト"
"全体（データベースと wp-config.php を含む）なので、指定した時間がたったら自動"
"で削除します。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:809
msgid ""
"This plugin is an add-on for All-in-One WP Migration (AI1WM). It is not an "
"official ServMask extension."
msgstr ""
"このプラグインは All-in-One WP Migration（AI1WM）の拡張です。ServMask 社の公"
"式の拡張機能ではありません。"

#. translators: %d: number of backups
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:817
#, php-format
msgid "Deleted %d backup."
msgid_plural "Deleted %d backups."
msgstr[0] "バックアップを %d 件削除しました。"

#. translators: %d: number of backups
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:825
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Could not delete %d backup. Check that the ai1wm-backups folder is writable."
msgid_plural ""
"Could not delete %d backups. Check that the ai1wm-backups folder is writable."
msgstr[0] ""
"バックアップ %d 件を削除できませんでした。ai1wm-backups フォルダの書き込み権"
"限をご確認ください。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:831
msgid ""
"All-in-One WP Migration is not active. This plugin is meant to delete AI1WM "
"backups. Any .wpress files left on the server are still deleted without "
"AI1WM."
msgstr ""
"All-in-One WP Migration が有効になっていません。このプラグインは AI1WM のバッ"
"クアップを消すためのものです。残っている .wpress がある場合は、AI1WM が無くて"
"も削除は動きます。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:837
msgid "Backups on the server"
msgstr "残っているバックアップ"

#. translators: %d: number of files
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:841
#, php-format
msgid "%d file"
msgid_plural "%d files"
msgstr[0] "%d 件"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:846
msgid "Total size"
msgstr "合計サイズ"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:850
msgid "Next auto-delete"
msgstr "次の自動削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:860
msgid "Time until deletion"
msgstr "削除までの時間"

#. translators: 1: shortest time, 2: longest time, 3: default time
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:865
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A backup is deleted once this much time has passed since it was last "
"written. You can set %1$s to %2$s (default: %3$s)."
msgstr ""
"バックアップが最後に書き込まれてから、この時間がたつと削除します。%1$s〜%2$s"
"の間で指定できます（既定は%3$s）。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:871
msgid ""
"Checks run every 10 minutes, so a file may be deleted up to about 10 minutes "
"late. Files are never deleted in the middle of an export."
msgstr ""
"確認は10分ごとなので、実際に消えるのは最大で10分ほど遅れます。エクスポートの"
"途中で消えることはありません。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:876
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "単位"

#. translators: 1: time, 2: constant name
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:890
#, php-format
msgid "Fixed to %1$s by %2$s in wp-config.php, so it cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"wp-config.php の %2$s で %1$s に固定されているため、ここでは変えられません。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:911
msgid "Backups on the server now"
msgstr "いま残っているバックアップ"

#. translators: %d: number of backups
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:915
#, php-format
msgid "Delete %d backup? This cannot be undone."
msgid_plural "Delete all %d backups? This cannot be undone."
msgstr[0] "バックアップ %d 件をすべて削除しますか？元に戻せません。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:918
msgid "Delete all"
msgstr "すべて削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:924
msgid "No backups right now."
msgstr "いま残っているバックアップはありません。"

#. translators: %s: file name
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:931
#, php-format
msgid "Delete %s? This cannot be undone."
msgstr "%s を削除しますか？元に戻せません。"

#. translators: %s: date and time
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:942
#, php-format
msgid "Last written %s"
msgstr "最後の書き込み %s"

#. translators: %s: remaining time
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:951
#, php-format
msgid "Auto-deletes in about %s"
msgstr "あと約%sで自動削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:952
msgid "Auto-deletes at the next check"
msgstr "次の確認で自動削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:957
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "削除"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:966
msgid "Open the AI1WM backups screen"
msgstr "AI1WM のバックアップ画面を開く"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:991
msgid "Could not auto-delete All-in-One WP Migration backups (.wpress)."
msgstr ""
"All-in-One WP Migration のバックアップ（.wpress）の自動削除に失敗しました。"

#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:992
msgid ""
"Check that the ai1wm-backups folder is writable. You can also delete the "
"files by FTP."
msgstr ""
"ai1wm-backups ディレクトリの書き込み権限をご確認ください（FTP などで手動で削"
"除することもできます）。"

#. translators: %s: list of file names
#: purge-ai1wm-backups.php:994
#, php-format
msgid "Files: %s"
msgstr "対象: %s"

msgid ""
"Backups that were already on the server when this plugin was activated are "
"counted from the time it was activated."
msgstr ""
"有効化した時点ですでにあったバックアップは、有効化した時刻から数えます。"

#. translators: 1: number of backups, 2: remaining time
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$d backup (.wpress) that was already on the server will be deleted "
"automatically in about %2$s. Download it before then if you need it."
msgid_plural ""
"%1$d backups (.wpress) that were already on the server will be deleted "
"automatically in about %2$s. Download them before then if you need them."
msgstr[0] ""
"有効化する前からあったバックアップ（.wpress）%1$d 件は、あと約%2$sで自動削除"
"されます。必要なものはそれまでにダウンロードしてください。"

msgid "See the backups"
msgstr "バックアップを見る"
